      "x-doc-role": "Item",
      "description": "This item stores the effective rights of a registry key that a discretionary access control list (DACL) structure grants to a specified trustee.\n\nThe trustee's effective rights are determined checking all access-allowed and access-denied access control entries (ACEs) in the DACL."
    },
